<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Charge Skill</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Barbarian (guild level 10)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre> charge &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>Headstrong and sometimes reckless, the Barbarian may attack without regard for their
own safety. A charge is a hard blow that starts the fight: the higher your level and
your skill, and the better your constitution and strength against your enemy's, the
harder it hits. But it always costs you some hit points as well, between a fifteenth
and a tenth of what you have.
</p><p>You need more than 20 endurance to charge, though a charge doesn't use any up. You
can't charge once you are fighting. You can charge at another player only when both
of you have signed the book of blood.
</p><p>Charging staffs and wands is something else: see <a cmd='#'>Help Charge Staff</a> and <a cmd='#'>Help Charge Wand</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre> &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Barbarian</a>
 &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Charge Staff</a>
 &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Charge Wand</a>
</pre>




</div>